WEBVTT

1
00:02:22,810 --> 00:02:23,811
Ini.

2
00:03:36,216 --> 00:03:37,985
Arco!

3
00:03:39,954 --> 00:03:41,656
Tanaman lagi?

4
00:03:42,156 --> 00:03:43,558
Kau kira kami membawa apa?

5
00:03:43,658 --> 00:03:45,593
Dinosaurus?/
Kau lihat?

6
00:03:45,693 --> 00:03:47,595
Induk triceratops.

7
00:03:47,862 --> 00:03:50,832
Besar sekali!
Dia memanggil anaknya begini:

8
00:03:51,165 --> 00:03:52,533
Rarrr!

9
00:03:52,633 --> 00:03:54,267
Di situlah Ada
menemukan paku itu,

10
00:03:54,367 --> 00:03:56,003
kalau tidak,
kami tak akan sadar.

11
00:03:56,104 --> 00:03:57,739
Kau belai?/
Belai?

12
00:03:57,839 --> 00:04:00,074
Kau bercanda?
Kami sangat takut.

13
00:04:00,174 --> 00:04:03,111
Kami bersembunyi.
Ayah sangat ketakutan.

14
00:04:03,544 --> 00:04:05,747
Seperti dugaanku,

15
00:04:05,947 --> 00:04:07,548
Dryopteris.

16
00:04:08,750 --> 00:04:10,818
Dengan ini, kita bisa
menumbuhkan ribuan.

17
00:04:10,918 --> 00:04:14,722
Ayah? Lain kali aku boleh ikut?

18
00:04:14,822 --> 00:04:16,691
Arco, kita sudah bahas.

19
00:04:16,791 --> 00:04:18,626
Kau terlalu kecil./
Tapi aku bisa membantu.

20
00:04:18,726 --> 00:04:22,022
Ya, yang dia mau
hanya melihat dino.

21
00:04:22,028 --> 00:04:22,730
Ada.

22
00:04:22,830 --> 00:04:24,498
Dia benar, kami tak bepergian
untuk bersenang-senang.

23
00:04:24,599 --> 00:04:26,234
Tapi aku siap.

24
00:04:26,333 --> 00:04:28,335
Tak boleh terbang
sebelum umur 12.

25
00:04:28,435 --> 00:04:30,270
Itu aturan.
Memang begitu.

26
00:04:30,538 --> 00:04:32,874
Waktumu akan tiba.
Jangan terburu-buru.

27
00:09:11,986 --> 00:09:14,455
<i>Kau siap?</i>/
Ya! Ya!

28
00:09:14,555 --> 00:09:16,057
Sekarang kita punya topi baru.

29
00:09:16,157 --> 00:09:18,192
<i>Kudengar ada pendatang baru
di barat,</i>

30
00:09:18,292 --> 00:09:21,929
<i>dua penjahat paling tangguh,
terutama si gadis,</i>

31
00:09:22,029 --> 00:09:25,599
<i>yang dikenal sebagai
Calamity Jane</i>

32
00:09:25,699 --> 00:09:29,203
<i>dengan kuku setajam cakar tua.</i>

33
00:09:29,303 --> 00:09:32,206
Semua sheriff mencarinya,

34
00:09:32,306 --> 00:09:34,175
tapi aku yang akan menemukannya!

35
00:09:36,844 --> 00:09:38,212
<i>Siapa lagi sekarang?</i>

36
00:09:39,180 --> 00:09:40,948
Hook! Hook!

37
00:09:41,048 --> 00:09:42,983
Hook! Hook! Hook!

38
00:09:49,990 --> 00:09:51,792
Hanya petir, Peter.

39
00:09:52,259 --> 00:09:55,629
Tenang, rumah kita
terlindung dari badai.

40
00:10:01,235 --> 00:10:03,604
Akhir-akhir ini
dia tak mau menurut.

41
00:10:03,971 --> 00:10:06,173
Dia maunya sendiri./
<i>Wajar.</i>

42
00:10:06,273 --> 00:10:09,578
<i>Di umur itu kau juga
nakal, bukan, Mikki?</i>

43
00:10:09,677 --> 00:10:12,213
<i>Benar-benar monster.</i>

44
00:10:12,313 --> 00:10:16,217
<i>Ayo, sayang. Makan buburnya.
Demi Ibu.</i>

45
00:10:16,518 --> 00:10:17,852
<i>Sekolahmu bagaimana?</i>

46
00:10:17,952 --> 00:10:19,854
<i>Presentasi sejarahmu?</i>

47
00:10:19,954 --> 00:10:21,655
Baik.

48
00:10:21,755 --> 00:10:23,791
Clifford sangat takut

49
00:10:23,891 --> 00:10:25,826
sampai lupa bagian tentang firaun.

50
00:10:26,093 --> 00:10:28,129
Dia gemetar begini.

51
00:10:30,631 --> 00:10:34,135
Mikki, kau sudah buat janji
vaksin Peter, 'kan?/ <i>Ya,</i>

52
00:10:34,235 --> 00:10:36,737
<i>besok dia booster</i>

53
00:10:36,837 --> 00:10:38,639
<i>dan aku belanja untuk Sabtu.</i>

54
00:10:38,739 --> 00:10:40,575
<i>Iris membuat pai lemon.</i>

55
00:10:40,674 --> 00:10:43,277
Mikki! Itu kejutan.

56
00:10:45,211 --> 00:10:46,280
<i>Maaf.</i>

57
00:10:46,380 --> 00:10:47,815
<i>Sebenarnya...</i>

58
00:10:48,048 --> 00:10:51,352
<i>kami tak bisa pulang akhir pekan ini,
banyak pekerjaan.</i>

59
00:10:51,452 --> 00:10:53,454
Lalu ulang tahunmu?

60
00:10:53,555 --> 00:10:55,890
<i>Kita rayakan lain waktu.</i>

61
00:10:55,990 --> 00:10:59,160
<i>Kami coba datang
akhir pekan depan, ya?</i>

62
00:10:59,960 --> 00:11:03,364
<i>"Aku muda, aku gembira!"</i>

63
00:11:03,831 --> 00:11:05,299
<i>Tentu itu konyol,</i>

64
00:11:05,399 --> 00:11:07,768
<i>namun membuktikan
pada Kapten Hook</i>

65
00:11:07,868 --> 00:11:10,572
<i>bahwa Peter tak tahu
siapa dirinya</i>

66
00:11:10,671 --> 00:11:12,673
<i>atau apa dirinya.</i>

67
00:11:12,773 --> 00:11:16,377
<i>Itulah puncak sopan santun."</i>

68
00:11:17,111 --> 00:11:18,112
Lalu?

69
00:11:18,979 --> 00:11:21,348
<i>Ibu harus bangun pagi.</i>

70
00:11:21,882 --> 00:11:24,752
<i>Matikan lampu sebentar lagi, ya?</i>/
Ya, Bu.

71
00:11:25,419 --> 00:11:27,354
<i>Ibu sangat sayang.</i>

72
00:11:29,023 --> 00:11:31,526
<i>Selamat malam, sayang.</i>

73
00:11:31,992 --> 00:11:33,427
Malam, Mama.

74
00:12:06,927 --> 00:12:09,230
<i>Semuanya baik?</i>

75
00:12:10,599 --> 00:12:11,932
Aku tak bisa tidur.

76
00:12:12,032 --> 00:12:14,368
<i>Geser sedikit untukku.</i>

77
00:12:17,037 --> 00:12:18,906
<i>Ada apa?</i>

78
00:12:20,441 --> 00:12:22,076
Tak apa.

79
00:12:22,176 --> 00:12:23,244
Aku baik.

80
00:12:23,477 --> 00:12:27,181
<i>Mereka pasti ingin bersamamu
daripada di kantor.</i>

81
00:12:27,281 --> 00:12:30,417
<i>Orang dewasa tak selalu
bisa sesukanya.</i>

82
00:12:31,885 --> 00:12:34,255
Menurutmu harapan bisa jadi nyata?

83
00:12:34,989 --> 00:12:36,558
Seperti dongeng?

84
00:12:36,658 --> 00:12:38,325
<i>Entahlah, Iris.</i>

85
00:12:38,693 --> 00:12:41,228
<i>Tapi tak ada yang
melarangmu mencoba.</i>

86
00:13:22,403 --> 00:13:24,639
Hai, Mikki!/
<i>Selamat pagi.</i>

87
00:13:24,739 --> 00:13:26,675
Telat lagi?/
<i>Iris!</i>

88
00:13:26,974 --> 00:13:28,809
<i>Clifford datang.</i>/
Ya!

89
00:13:28,909 --> 00:13:31,412
<i>Kau akan terlambat!</i>/
Iya!

90
00:13:37,017 --> 00:13:40,154
<i>Hati-hati di jalan, ya?</i>/
Ya, Mikki!

91
00:13:40,254 --> 00:13:42,489
Dah!

92
00:13:42,657 --> 00:13:43,857
Cepat!

93
00:13:44,291 --> 00:13:46,226
Kenapa kau selalu yang mengemudi?

94
00:13:46,327 --> 00:13:48,462
Karena skuternya punyaku./
<i>Iris!</i>

95
00:13:48,563 --> 00:13:51,098
<i>Kubilang hati-hati!</i>

96
00:13:51,566 --> 00:13:54,502
<i>Adikmu keras kepala sekali.</i>

97
00:13:55,102 --> 00:13:57,037
Itu mobil Tn. Deschmaker?

98
00:13:57,304 --> 00:14:00,307
Iya.
Dia pasti marah.

99
00:14:10,918 --> 00:14:13,487
Menurutmuvburung bersembunyi
di mana saat badai?

100
00:14:13,588 --> 00:14:16,658
Entah, tak pernah kupikirkan.

101
00:14:17,324 --> 00:14:18,959
Dulu aku ingin jadi burung

102
00:14:19,059 --> 00:14:20,861
agar bisa terbang bebas.

103
00:14:21,895 --> 00:14:24,632
Tapi pasti mengerikan.

104
00:14:25,032 --> 00:14:26,835
Aku ingin jadi kucing:

105
00:14:26,934 --> 00:14:29,970
tak perlu apa-apa,
jalan-jalan, diberi makan.

106
00:14:30,170 --> 00:14:31,939
Kucing enak hidupnya.

107
00:14:32,707 --> 00:14:35,442
Tapi aku tak suka kucing
karena makan burung.

108
00:14:36,210 --> 00:14:38,312
Kau lihat berita kebakaran?

109
00:14:38,412 --> 00:14:41,816
Ayahku bilang kali ini
akan menghancurkan semua.

110
00:14:41,915 --> 00:14:43,884
Dia selalu bilang begitu.

111
00:14:43,984 --> 00:14:46,420
Kami punya makanan kaleng
berbulan-bulan.

112
00:14:46,521 --> 00:14:50,265
Kau taruh di mana?/
Di ruang tamu, di kamarku.

113
00:14:50,348 --> 00:14:51,933
Aku tidur di atas kacang merah.

114
00:14:53,193 --> 00:14:55,963
Sampai nanti siang?/
Ya, sampai nanti.

115
00:15:00,568 --> 00:15:02,302
<i>Alam semesta,</i>
<i>seperti makhluk hidup,</i>

116
00:15:02,403 --> 00:15:04,773
<i>lahir suatu hari.</i>

117
00:15:04,873 --> 00:15:06,974
<i>Itu terjadi
13,8 miliar tahun lalu</i>

118
00:15:07,074 --> 00:15:10,210
<i>dalam kilatan besar
yang disebut Big Bang.</i>

119
00:15:10,310 --> 00:15:13,247
<i>Sebelumnya,
ruang dan waktu belum ada.</i>

120
00:15:13,515 --> 00:15:16,483
<i>Saat lahir,
beratnya hanya 20 mikrogram,</i>

121
00:15:16,584 --> 00:15:18,586
<i>seberat butir pasir.</i>

122
00:15:18,686 --> 00:15:22,189
<i>7,7 pon lebih ringan
darimu saat lahir,</i>

123
00:15:22,289 --> 00:15:24,592
<i>lalu tumbuh</i>

124
00:15:24,692 --> 00:15:27,928
<i>membentuk galaksi
dan tata surya kita. Ya?</i>

125
00:15:29,496 --> 00:15:30,998
Aku tak enak badan.

126
00:15:31,198 --> 00:15:33,000
Boleh izin?

127
00:15:33,100 --> 00:15:34,769
<i>Tinggal 15 menit lagi.</i>

128
00:15:34,869 --> 00:15:37,070
Aku sakit kepala.

129
00:15:38,238 --> 00:15:39,774
<i>Baiklah, silakan.</i>

130
00:15:39,874 --> 00:15:41,175
Terima kasih.

131
00:15:45,814 --> 00:15:47,347
<i>Baik, lanjut.</i>

132
00:15:47,448 --> 00:15:49,450
<i>Empat setengah
miliar tahun lalu...</i>

133
00:17:33,588 --> 00:17:35,188
Kau baik-baik saja?

134
00:17:36,156 --> 00:17:37,525
Jatuhnya keras.

135
00:17:38,358 --> 00:17:40,360
Ada yang patah?

136
00:17:41,629 --> 00:17:42,797
Hei!

137
00:17:55,643 --> 00:17:57,110
Siapa kau?

138
00:17:57,210 --> 00:17:58,445
Kita mau ke mana?

139
00:17:58,546 --> 00:18:00,682
Bicaramu terlalu keras,
semua bisa mendengarmu.

140
00:18:00,782 --> 00:18:02,182
Kau keterlaluan!

141
00:18:02,282 --> 00:18:04,084
Apa?/
Aku menangkap sinyal.

142
00:18:04,184 --> 00:18:05,987
Bunyi terus./
Lihat!

143
00:18:06,119 --> 00:18:07,454
Lihat, bunyi!/
Aku juga!

144
00:18:07,555 --> 00:18:09,456
Astaga!/
Kita harus berpencar.

145
00:18:09,557 --> 00:18:11,793
Baik? Dougie!/
Ya?

146
00:18:11,893 --> 00:18:13,460
Kau ke utara./
Baik.

147
00:18:13,561 --> 00:18:14,963
Aku dan Frankie ke selatan.

148
00:18:15,063 --> 00:18:16,496
Tunggu, serius?

149
00:18:16,598 --> 00:18:19,000
Kenapa aku yang.../
Ini bukan soal kau saja!

150
00:18:19,099 --> 00:18:20,868
Bukan soal aku saja?
Kau gila.

151
00:18:20,969 --> 00:18:24,505
Kau ke sana sendiri
dan kami berdua akan...

152
00:18:32,479 --> 00:18:34,882
Apa yang harus kulakukan?

153
00:18:44,257 --> 00:18:46,060
Berat sekali!

154
00:18:52,867 --> 00:18:55,036
Halo, Tuan-tuan.

155
00:18:59,674 --> 00:19:02,744
Kalian juga mencari harta karun?

156
00:19:04,512 --> 00:19:05,312
Apa?!

157
00:19:05,412 --> 00:19:08,049
Maksudku, aku melihat pelangi.

158
00:19:08,148 --> 00:19:10,417
Kalian tahu legendanya?

159
00:19:10,785 --> 00:19:13,121
Di ujung pelangi ada emas...

160
00:19:13,253 --> 00:19:15,123
Dengar, kami sibuk.
Pergilah.

161
00:19:15,222 --> 00:19:17,659
Jangan kasar, Frankie!

162
00:19:17,992 --> 00:19:19,694
Ayolah!/
Maaf.

163
00:19:19,794 --> 00:19:22,162
Gadis kecil, apakah...

164
00:19:22,563 --> 00:19:25,867
kau melihat sesuatu
yang aneh di hutan?

165
00:19:26,801 --> 00:19:27,969
Tidak.

166
00:19:28,069 --> 00:19:29,537
Kau yakin?

167
00:19:29,637 --> 00:19:31,371
Maksudku...

168
00:19:32,172 --> 00:19:33,975
ada seorang anak laki-laki kecil.

169
00:19:34,075 --> 00:19:35,375
Anak laki-laki kecil?!

170
00:19:35,475 --> 00:19:37,177
Benar.

171
00:19:37,277 --> 00:19:39,047
Dia lari ke arah sana.

172
00:19:39,147 --> 00:19:41,181
Kau pasti langsung mengenalinya
dari pakaiannya yang aneh.

173
00:19:41,448 --> 00:19:43,785
Luar biasa!

174
00:19:43,885 --> 00:19:47,220
Apa dia memakai kostum cerah
dengan jubah? Jubah?

175
00:19:47,320 --> 00:19:49,524
Ya, penuh warna.

176
00:19:49,624 --> 00:19:51,425
Menurutmu dia juga
mencari harta karun?

177
00:19:51,526 --> 00:19:53,460
Pasti dia.
Kau dengar sendiri tadi.

178
00:19:53,561 --> 00:19:55,495
Anak berjubah!
Ayo, cepat!

179
00:19:55,596 --> 00:19:57,431
Sampai jumpa. Terima kasih, Nona.

180
00:19:57,532 --> 00:19:59,299
Ayo, tak ada waktu!/
Terima kasih banyak, Nona.

181
00:19:59,399 --> 00:20:01,301
Jadi apa rencananya sekarang?

182
00:20:01,401 --> 00:20:03,705
Rencananya,
aku dan Dougie ke Utara.

183
00:20:03,805 --> 00:20:06,206
Tidak! Sudah kubilang
aku tak mau!

184
00:21:09,604 --> 00:21:10,872
Mikki!

185
00:21:10,972 --> 00:21:13,641
Aku mulai benar-benar khawatir.

186
00:21:14,075 --> 00:21:16,443
Tolong bantu aku.

187
00:21:16,544 --> 00:21:18,946
Tadi dia seperti linglung,
lalu tiba-tiba, boom!

188
00:21:19,046 --> 00:21:21,516
Dia pingsan!/
Kita harus segera menanganinya

189
00:21:21,616 --> 00:21:24,417
atau dia akan mendapat
bekas luka yang parah.

190
00:21:24,519 --> 00:21:26,587
Ambilkan kotak P3K, tolong.

191
00:21:26,687 --> 00:21:29,157
Di mana?/
Di kamar mandi atas,

192
00:21:29,257 --> 00:21:31,424
laci paling atas
di bawah wastafel.

193
00:21:40,701 --> 00:21:43,971
Dia baik-baik saja,
tak ada cedera serius,

194
00:21:44,071 --> 00:21:46,007
hanya luka kecil itu.

195
00:21:46,107 --> 00:21:47,642
Sini.

196
00:21:50,912 --> 00:21:52,680
Mari kita mulai.

197
00:21:54,447 --> 00:21:57,285
Sepertinya perlu
setidaknya delapan jahitan.

198
00:22:00,320 --> 00:22:01,923
Menjijikkan!

199
00:22:05,159 --> 00:22:06,761
Mereka tak mengangkatnya.

200
00:22:08,196 --> 00:22:09,630
Mungkin mereka sibuk di kantor.

201
00:22:09,730 --> 00:22:11,666
Tolong siapkan meja makan.

202
00:22:12,266 --> 00:22:14,334
Kau kira dia leprechaun?/
Aku tak yakin

203
00:22:14,434 --> 00:22:15,970
makhluk seperti itu ada, Iris.

204
00:22:16,070 --> 00:22:17,404
Lalu dia apa?

205
00:22:17,505 --> 00:22:19,173
Kau lihat jubahnya?

206
00:22:19,273 --> 00:22:20,641
Entahlah,

207
00:22:21,108 --> 00:22:23,311
tapi yang lebih tak kupahami

208
00:22:23,410 --> 00:22:24,545
kenapa kau sendirian di hutan.

209
00:22:24,645 --> 00:22:26,747
Sudah kubilang.
Aku melihat pelangi.

210
00:22:26,848 --> 00:22:29,617
Iris, aku tahu
kau bosan di kelas,

211
00:22:29,717 --> 00:22:31,384
tapi kau tak bisa
keluar sekolah begitu saja.

212
00:22:31,652 --> 00:22:33,955
Bukankah anak yang jatuh
dari langit itu penting?

213
00:22:34,421 --> 00:22:36,257
Anak kecil tak jatuh dari langit.

214
00:22:36,356 --> 00:22:38,092
Menurutku dia penyihir.

215
00:22:38,192 --> 00:22:39,560
Atau mungkin malaikat.

216
00:22:39,660 --> 00:22:42,063
Kau bisa menanyakannya
saat dia bangun.

217
00:22:44,765 --> 00:22:46,399
Sudah tiga jam
kita berputar-putar.

218
00:22:46,499 --> 00:22:48,536
Ini sia-sia!/
Aku tak mengerti.

219
00:22:48,636 --> 00:22:49,704
Sinyalnya makin lemah,

220
00:22:49,804 --> 00:22:51,906
tapi alatnya bilang di sini.

221
00:22:52,472 --> 00:22:54,675
Alatmu tak pernah benar, Dougie.

222
00:22:54,942 --> 00:22:57,444
Sampah. Aku menyerah.

223
00:22:57,545 --> 00:23:00,314
Gadis kecil itu agak aneh.

224
00:23:00,413 --> 00:23:02,650
Mungkin kita harus
menghadapi kenyataan.

225
00:23:02,750 --> 00:23:05,186
Sudah 20 tahun
kita membuang waktu.

226
00:23:05,452 --> 00:23:07,387
Hei, lihat!/
Ya?

227
00:23:07,487 --> 00:23:09,456
Apa?/
Lihat itu.

228
00:23:15,943 --> 00:23:16,831
Apa itu?

229
00:23:18,165 --> 00:23:21,168
Entah, tapi
sepertinya bukan dari sini.

230
00:23:34,782 --> 00:23:35,883
Arco?

231
00:23:40,721 --> 00:23:41,989
Arco?

232
00:23:43,557 --> 00:23:45,126
Ada apa?

233
00:23:47,194 --> 00:23:48,495
Arco?!

234
00:23:54,535 --> 00:23:56,504
Arco?

235
00:23:56,604 --> 00:23:58,739
Tidak, tidak! Tidak!

236
00:23:59,173 --> 00:24:00,174
Arco!

237
00:24:00,274 --> 00:24:02,043
Arco!

238
00:24:10,017 --> 00:24:11,118
Kau tak apa-apa?

239
00:24:11,552 --> 00:24:13,854
Kau ingat aku di hutan tadi?

240
00:24:14,255 --> 00:24:16,757
Siapa namamu?
Namaku Iris.

241
00:24:18,092 --> 00:24:20,261
Ini tahun berapa?

242
00:24:20,561 --> 00:24:21,796
Yah...

243
00:24:22,530 --> 00:24:23,965
2075.

244
00:24:24,065 --> 00:24:26,934
Orang tuaku pasti akan membunuhku.

245
00:24:28,102 --> 00:24:29,303
Kau dari mana?

246
00:24:29,403 --> 00:24:31,639
Baju terbangku!
Di mana?

247
00:24:32,373 --> 00:24:33,341
Di mesin.

248
00:24:33,441 --> 00:24:34,809
Mesin apa?

249
00:24:34,909 --> 00:24:36,911
Mesin cuci./
Kembalikan!

250
00:24:37,011 --> 00:24:38,612
Sekarang!/
Baik, baik.

251
00:24:39,046 --> 00:24:41,649
Tunggu di sini,
aku segera kembali.

252
00:25:45,046 --> 00:25:47,815
Kau mendapat delapan jahitan.

253
00:25:47,915 --> 00:25:49,917
Nanti akan larut sendiri.

254
00:25:50,017 --> 00:25:51,318
Tenang.

255
00:25:51,419 --> 00:25:53,421
Dia tak akan melukaimu.
Namanya Mikki.

256
00:25:53,821 --> 00:25:55,322
Dia yang merawatmu.

257
00:25:55,423 --> 00:25:56,791
Siapa namamu?

258
00:25:58,159 --> 00:25:59,293
Arco.

259
00:25:59,393 --> 00:26:01,195
Arco siapa?

260
00:26:01,495 --> 00:26:03,064
Arco Dorell.

261
00:26:04,298 --> 00:26:05,566
Kau tak terdaftar.

262
00:26:06,000 --> 00:26:07,868
Kau.../
Tapi Mikki, dia ada di sini.

263
00:26:12,106 --> 00:26:14,075
Mikki, ada apa denganmu?

264
00:26:16,577 --> 00:26:18,547
Mikki, kau dengar?

265
00:26:20,581 --> 00:26:22,917
Wah, kau membuatnya rusak.

266
00:26:23,017 --> 00:26:24,418
Apa dia mati?

267
00:26:24,519 --> 00:26:26,187
Tentu tidak.
Robot tak mati.

268
00:26:27,522 --> 00:26:28,956
Ayo, Mikki.

269
00:26:29,056 --> 00:26:30,224
Mulai ulang.

270
00:26:30,525 --> 00:26:31,926
Kelihatannya mati.

271
00:26:32,026 --> 00:26:34,128
Ayo, bantu aku letakkan di sofa.

272
00:26:37,631 --> 00:26:41,168
Berat!/
Aku tahu. Model lama.

273
00:26:47,875 --> 00:26:49,076
Robot apa yang kau punya?

274
00:26:52,246 --> 00:26:54,014
Kau tak punya robot?

275
00:26:54,115 --> 00:26:55,382
Siapa yanng mengurus?

276
00:26:55,483 --> 00:26:58,085
Siapa yang membersihkan,
mencuci, memasak?

277
00:26:58,185 --> 00:26:59,820
Kami sendiri.

278
00:27:00,254 --> 00:27:01,789
Jadi, kau dari mana?

279
00:27:07,995 --> 00:27:10,565
Itu bot asuransi.
Mereka tak boleh melihatmu.

280
00:27:11,098 --> 00:27:12,833
Sembunyi di sini
dan jangan bergerak.

281
00:27:12,933 --> 00:27:14,969
Tapi... aku tak bisa di sini!

282
00:27:15,069 --> 00:27:17,506
Baik! Baik!/
Aku harus pergi!

283
00:27:17,606 --> 00:27:18,973
Jangan terbang.

284
00:27:22,877 --> 00:27:25,679
Selamat pagi, Nona.
Kami menerima laporan gangguan

285
00:27:25,779 --> 00:27:27,181
pada robot pengasuh Anda, Mikki,

286
00:27:27,281 --> 00:27:30,619
nomor seri 28976.
Benar?

287
00:27:30,718 --> 00:27:32,319
Ya, benar.
Di ruang tamu.

288
00:27:32,419 --> 00:27:34,922
Bisakah Anda menjelaskan
apa yang terjadi?

289
00:27:35,356 --> 00:27:38,759
Entah, tiba-tiba
dia bicara tak jelas.

290
00:27:38,859 --> 00:27:40,861
Ada banyak gangguan
di wilayah ini,

291
00:27:40,961 --> 00:27:43,464
tepatnya 312, karena badai.

292
00:27:43,565 --> 00:27:45,432
Sudah berapa lama Anda memilikinya?/
Sudah lama.

293
00:27:46,300 --> 00:27:47,801
Apa ini serius?

294
00:27:48,169 --> 00:27:51,138
Rekan saya akan melakukan
pemeriksaan standar.

295
00:27:51,238 --> 00:27:52,673
Hanya beberapa menit.

296
00:27:53,741 --> 00:27:55,142
Boleh?

297
00:28:03,984 --> 00:28:05,986
Sepertinya ada kesalahan 404.

298
00:28:07,522 --> 00:28:08,889
Parah?

299
00:28:08,989 --> 00:28:11,626
Tak perlu khawatir,
masih bisa diperbaiki.

300
00:28:12,026 --> 00:28:13,360
Berapa lama?

301
00:28:13,662 --> 00:28:15,062
Sulit dipastikan.

302
00:28:15,162 --> 00:28:18,132
Layanan kami penuh
sejak kemarin.

303
00:28:27,808 --> 00:28:29,043
Oh tidak.

304
00:28:31,680 --> 00:28:34,481
Tidak, tidak, tidak!

305
00:29:45,953 --> 00:29:47,454
Kau mengerti
apa yang mereka katakan?

306
00:29:48,989 --> 00:29:51,358
Mereka bilang
kau orang yang baik.

307
00:29:59,734 --> 00:30:01,969
Biasanya mereka keras pada kami.

308
00:30:13,013 --> 00:30:15,750
Iris, berlianku,
kembalikan padaku.

309
00:30:16,083 --> 00:30:19,486
Apa?/
Ada berlian di baju terbangku.

310
00:30:19,587 --> 00:30:21,055
Aku tak melihat berlian.

311
00:30:21,322 --> 00:30:23,190
Mungkin terjatuh
saat kau jatuh di hutan?

312
00:30:23,290 --> 00:30:25,727
Kalau begitu,
kita kembali sekarang.

313
00:30:25,826 --> 00:30:28,495
Baik, tapi katakan dulu
kau dari mana.

314
00:30:28,996 --> 00:30:30,732
Aku tak bisa./
Terserah.

315
00:30:30,831 --> 00:30:32,299
Semoga berhasil./
Tunggu!

316
00:30:33,033 --> 00:30:34,501
Aku tak bisa pulang tanpanya.

317
00:30:35,235 --> 00:30:36,303
Sayang sekali.

318
00:30:36,571 --> 00:30:38,339
Itu tidak adil!

319
00:30:39,273 --> 00:30:41,041
Kumohon!

320
00:30:41,141 --> 00:30:42,777
Dengar itu, Peter?
Dia ingin pulang.

321
00:30:43,143 --> 00:30:44,945
Orang tuaku pasti akan khawatir.

322
00:30:45,212 --> 00:30:46,648
Aku sedang sibuk.

323
00:30:46,748 --> 00:30:48,650
Seseorang baru saja
merusak robotku.

324
00:30:48,750 --> 00:30:50,652
Tunggu, tunggu!

325
00:30:50,752 --> 00:30:52,186
Baiklah.

326
00:30:52,453 --> 00:30:53,954
Akan kukatakan.

327
00:30:54,823 --> 00:30:56,490
Yah...

328
00:30:59,093 --> 00:31:00,861
Aku dari masa depan.

329
00:31:01,895 --> 00:31:04,064
Kupikir hanya ada robot,

330
00:31:04,164 --> 00:31:06,634
dan kita semua jadi mesin.

331
00:31:06,735 --> 00:31:09,103
Ternyata masih ada manusia?/
Tentu saja.

332
00:31:09,203 --> 00:31:11,539
Bagaimana keadaannya? Ceritakan!

333
00:31:11,639 --> 00:31:13,974
Apa es kutub mencair?
Masih ada koala?

334
00:31:14,074 --> 00:31:16,076
Aku suka koala,
lucu sekali,

335
00:31:16,176 --> 00:31:17,812
meski katanya
mereka galak satu sama lain.

336
00:31:17,911 --> 00:31:19,748
Bisakah kita pergi sekarang?

337
00:31:19,848 --> 00:31:21,382
Ya, tentu.

338
00:31:22,650 --> 00:31:25,252
Tapi jangan dengan pakaian itu.

339
00:31:36,263 --> 00:31:39,199
Tiang-tiang berkabel itu apa?

340
00:31:39,299 --> 00:31:41,803
Itu menyalurkan listrik
ke rumah kami.

341
00:31:41,902 --> 00:31:43,303
Di tempatmu tidak ada?

342
00:31:43,772 --> 00:31:46,373
Tidak, rumah kami mandiri.

343
00:31:46,641 --> 00:31:47,941
Maksudnya?

344
00:31:48,342 --> 00:31:49,644
Mereka menghasilkan energi sendiri.

345
00:31:51,945 --> 00:31:54,549
Dan kotak kecil itu apa?

346
00:31:55,683 --> 00:31:56,785
Tebak.

347
00:31:57,050 --> 00:31:58,686
Tempat makan burung?

348
00:31:58,787 --> 00:32:00,387
Bukan.

349
00:32:00,487 --> 00:32:03,257
Itu kotak surat./
"Kotak surat"?

350
00:32:03,991 --> 00:32:05,727
Untuk menerima pesan,

351
00:32:05,827 --> 00:32:08,462
tapi sekarang jarang dipakai.

352
00:32:08,929 --> 00:32:10,964
Biasanya hanya kabar buruk.

353
00:32:11,064 --> 00:32:13,902
Dan... orang tuamu?

354
00:32:14,001 --> 00:32:16,905
Mereka sudah tiada?/
Tidak.

355
00:32:17,271 --> 00:32:20,140
Mereka bekerja di kota
dan pulang saat akhir pekan.

356
00:32:20,240 --> 00:32:22,877
Wah, kau beruntung.

357
00:32:22,976 --> 00:32:24,445
Orang tuaku selalu mengomel.

358
00:32:25,245 --> 00:32:27,014
Ayahku selalu berkata,

359
00:32:27,114 --> 00:32:29,116
"Jangan lakukan ini, Arco.

360
00:32:29,216 --> 00:32:31,452
Jangan lakukan itu, Arco."

361
00:32:35,690 --> 00:32:37,859
Kau yakin di sinilah
kau menemukanku?

362
00:32:37,958 --> 00:32:39,527
Ya, tentu!

363
00:32:39,694 --> 00:32:41,061
Seperti apa bentuknya?

364
00:32:41,161 --> 00:32:43,197
Seperti permen kaca besar.

365
00:32:44,431 --> 00:32:45,600
Sebesar apa?

366
00:32:45,867 --> 00:32:47,267
Kira-kira sebesar ini.

367
00:32:47,367 --> 00:32:49,704
Dan berlian besar ini
berfungsi apa?

368
00:32:50,037 --> 00:32:51,472
Ia membiaskan cahaya.

369
00:32:51,573 --> 00:32:53,842
Tanpanya, kita tak bisa
melintasi waktu.

370
00:32:53,942 --> 00:32:55,944
Tak punya cadangan?

371
00:32:56,043 --> 00:32:58,078
Atau rencana B?

372
00:32:59,313 --> 00:33:03,383
Harus hujan
dan cerah bersamaan,

373
00:33:03,718 --> 00:33:05,285
tapi itu sangat jarang.

374
00:33:06,721 --> 00:33:08,489
Selesai sudah, aku mati.

375
00:33:09,223 --> 00:33:10,991
Tunggu sebentar.

376
00:33:11,191 --> 00:33:13,528
Aku punya ide.

377
00:33:20,133 --> 00:33:21,503
<i>Perhatian, para pembeli,</i>

378
00:33:21,603 --> 00:33:23,505
<i>kami ingin mengingatkan
pelanggan setia kami</i>

379
00:33:23,605 --> 00:33:26,774
<i>batasnya lima barang
yang sama per orang.</i>

380
00:33:27,007 --> 00:33:30,210
<i>Sekali lagi, lima barang
yang sama per orang.</i>

381
00:33:30,310 --> 00:33:32,379
Wah!

382
00:33:37,117 --> 00:33:38,385
Hei!

383
00:33:38,485 --> 00:33:39,486
Iris!

384
00:33:41,053 --> 00:33:42,089
Hei.

385
00:33:42,189 --> 00:33:43,992
Kau kemari mengambil persediaan?

386
00:33:44,091 --> 00:33:45,292
Kau lihat beritanya?
Katanya

387
00:33:45,392 --> 00:33:47,662
kita akan benar-benar
terkurung di rumah.

388
00:33:47,762 --> 00:33:49,664
Clifford, temui aku di kasir.

389
00:33:49,964 --> 00:33:52,032
Ya, Ayah, datang.

390
00:33:53,668 --> 00:33:55,235
Clifford, ini Arco.

391
00:33:55,335 --> 00:33:56,270
Sepupuku!

392
00:33:57,204 --> 00:34:00,642
Arco, Clifford teman sekolahku./
Hai, Arco.

393
00:34:05,379 --> 00:34:07,815
Kalau seseorang mengulurkan
tangan, kau salami.

394
00:34:07,916 --> 00:34:09,216
Itu sopan.

395
00:34:09,784 --> 00:34:12,119
Kalau tidak,
orang akan menganggapmu aneh

396
00:34:12,219 --> 00:34:14,221
dan mulai bertanya-tanya,

397
00:34:14,321 --> 00:34:16,658
dan kau tak mau
mereka bertanya.

398
00:34:21,896 --> 00:34:24,097
Ini tepat yang kita butuhkan.

399
00:34:26,133 --> 00:34:28,268
Aku belum pernah melihatnya.

400
00:34:28,368 --> 00:34:30,038
Bisa saja cuma
perhiasan plastik

401
00:34:30,137 --> 00:34:32,072
yang dijatuhkan anak kecil.

402
00:34:32,172 --> 00:34:33,575
Diam, Stewie,
kau takkan tahu bedanya

403
00:34:33,675 --> 00:34:35,610
pecahan kaca dan zamrud.

404
00:34:37,011 --> 00:34:38,145
Aku mengganggumu, Dougie?

405
00:34:38,245 --> 00:34:39,413
Kau membuatku
kehilangan halaman.

406
00:34:39,514 --> 00:34:41,448
Mau apa dengan barang itu?

407
00:34:41,549 --> 00:34:43,183
Bersih-bersih rumah,
pernah dengar?

408
00:34:43,283 --> 00:34:44,719
Kau tahu artinya?

409
00:34:44,819 --> 00:34:46,219
Di dalam seperti kandang babi.

410
00:34:46,320 --> 00:34:47,655
Kau tak pernah merapikan.

411
00:34:47,755 --> 00:34:49,389
Semua menumpuk, aku tak tahan!

412
00:34:54,161 --> 00:34:55,495
Hei, kalian!/
Apa?

413
00:34:55,597 --> 00:34:57,732
Itu gadis kecil dari hutan.

414
00:34:57,999 --> 00:34:59,299
Ambilkan Oxybul.

415
00:34:59,399 --> 00:35:01,069
Benar!

416
00:35:01,168 --> 00:35:03,370
Maaf, apa?/
Penguat suara!

417
00:35:03,470 --> 00:35:04,939
Oh ya!
Benar.

418
00:35:07,575 --> 00:35:09,777
Aku... dapat! Dapat!

419
00:35:12,847 --> 00:35:14,214
Baiklah.

420
00:35:14,314 --> 00:35:16,050
Tak ada suara.

421
00:35:18,285 --> 00:35:20,287
Telingaku!/
Tunggu, kuatur volumenya.

422
00:35:20,387 --> 00:35:21,656
Mereka bicara apa?

423
00:35:21,756 --> 00:35:23,625
Tak terlalu jelas.
Bayinya menangis,

424
00:35:23,891 --> 00:35:26,326
sepertinya soal botol susu.

425
00:35:26,426 --> 00:35:28,563
Bagus, membantu sekali!

426
00:35:33,200 --> 00:35:35,770
Luar biasa
betapa tenangnya dia denganmu.

427
00:35:36,203 --> 00:35:39,473
Dengan Mikki dia rewel sekali.

428
00:35:56,156 --> 00:35:57,659
Sandwichmu.

429
00:35:58,826 --> 00:36:00,293
Favoritku.

430
00:36:05,867 --> 00:36:07,769
Kau suka?

431
00:36:08,069 --> 00:36:09,871
Aku sangat lapar.

432
00:36:16,209 --> 00:36:18,880
Menakjubkan semua begitu berbeda.

433
00:36:19,179 --> 00:36:21,314
Seperti apa di waktumu?

434
00:36:21,616 --> 00:36:23,851
Hampir semuanya di bawah air.

435
00:36:23,951 --> 00:36:26,688
Laut naik banyak
sejak Masa Vakum Besar.

436
00:36:26,788 --> 00:36:28,790
Masa Vakum Besar?

437
00:36:28,890 --> 00:36:32,527
Saat kami pindah ke dataran tinggi
agar Bumi beristirahat.

438
00:36:32,627 --> 00:36:34,528
Kini kami tinggal di awan.

439
00:36:35,262 --> 00:36:37,165
Rumah dibangun di platform

440
00:36:37,264 --> 00:36:38,733
dan ditambatkan ke pilar besar,

441
00:36:39,167 --> 00:36:42,070
seperti pohon raksasa.

442
00:36:42,335 --> 00:36:43,738
Tunggu.

443
00:36:59,386 --> 00:37:00,588
Seperti ini?

444
00:37:00,688 --> 00:37:03,390
Ya, hanya saja rumah kami bulat.

445
00:37:03,490 --> 00:37:06,527
Kakakku bilang kami tinggal
di cangkang kura-kura.

446
00:37:08,328 --> 00:37:09,496
Dan taman besar.

447
00:37:09,764 --> 00:37:11,566
Berisik!
Tak terdengar!

448
00:37:11,666 --> 00:37:13,266
Mereka bicara apa?

449
00:37:13,366 --> 00:37:15,203
Tentang rumah pohon.

450
00:37:15,302 --> 00:37:16,771
Apa?

451
00:37:16,871 --> 00:37:18,305
Apa? Vakum?

452
00:37:18,405 --> 00:37:22,930
Vakum./
Apa itu?

453
00:37:29,108 --> 00:37:30,972
Seperti ini?

454
00:37:31,283 --> 00:37:33,112
Mirip rumahku.

455
00:37:33,389 --> 00:37:35,149
Gambarmu bagus sekali.

456
00:37:35,805 --> 00:37:38,359
Boleh kusimpan?/
Nanti kubuat yang lebih bagus.

457
00:37:39,912 --> 00:37:42,087
Andai aku bisa menggambar.

458
00:37:42,363 --> 00:37:45,263
Kau bisa mengekspresikan
apa pun yang kau pikirkan.

459
00:37:46,505 --> 00:37:48,404
Aku ingin bisa bicara
dengan burung.

460
00:37:48,507 --> 00:37:51,338
Mudah!
Semua orang bisa.

461
00:37:51,924 --> 00:37:54,513
Kau bisa mengajariku?/
Burung apa?

462
00:37:56,276 --> 00:37:57,912
Tak tahu.

463
00:37:58,345 --> 00:38:00,047
Burung hitam./
Itu paling sulit.

464
00:38:00,815 --> 00:38:02,049
Kalau begitu merpati.

465
00:38:04,799 --> 00:38:07,285
Kau menggodaku./
Tidak!

466
00:38:07,388 --> 00:38:09,873
Kau bilang apa?/
Aku bilang...

467
00:38:10,736 --> 00:38:12,013
aku suka kau.

468
00:38:18,331 --> 00:38:20,668
Kau bilang sesuatu
yang tak baik.

469
00:38:20,768 --> 00:38:22,770
Oh ya? Apa?/
Tidak!

470
00:38:22,870 --> 00:38:26,040
Tak bisa kuulang.
Menjijikkan.

471
00:38:33,413 --> 00:38:35,583
Tidak! Tidak!

472
00:38:39,386 --> 00:38:41,222
Jadi mereka bicara apa?/
Kata-kata manis

473
00:38:41,354 --> 00:38:42,322
dalam bahasa burung.

474
00:38:44,391 --> 00:38:45,993
Katakan sesuatu
dalam bahasa pipit.

475
